WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:02.600
Chara-su!

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.810
Hi! Is everyone shugo-peppy again today?

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.170
As for us...

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.480
We're shugo-shugo-peppy!

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.010
Any of you kids feeling blue?

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.690
If you are, just Character Change with Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:17.290
Here we go! Everyone's hearts:

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.680
Unlock!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.700
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.210
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.010
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.880
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.730
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.610
you're like a dream.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.460
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.350
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.190
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:41.990
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:45.790
Whenever I start something new

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:49.500
I get really excited,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.170
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:56.310
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:01:03.950
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:07.740
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:11.870
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.490
It's party time!

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:20.240
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:23.980
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:28.180
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.390
It's party time!

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:35.100
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.610
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:43.240
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.030
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.860
Hiyas, my little Eggs!

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.370
Which anime's up first on Shugo Chara Party?

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.050
The one starring the Guardian Characters!

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:56.840
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:59.680
I wonder which Guardian Characters will show up today?

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:01.050
Let's check it out!

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:02.790
Enjoy!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.790
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:14.100
"She Just Can't Stop!"

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.440
Morning.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.110
A very good morning to you!

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.790
Good morning, girls!

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:23.460
The weather!

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.180
Sure is great today!

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.880
Something's odd.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.940
Ran, what's the deal?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.310
Would you please stop for a second?

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:37.750
Actually I... can't!

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:40.520
What happened?

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:44.280
Well, it just feels so good to run,

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.860
I can't stop anymore!

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.740
Like when you run down a steep hill, huh?

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.860
We don't have time to think about it!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:55.070
We've got to stop her somehow!

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:58.610
"Perfect Plan to Somehow Stop Ran from Running!"

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.240
Or "PSR," for short!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.450
Can the weird acronyms, all right?

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.150
Here she comes!

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.580
Okay!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.650
Impressive, Ran.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:18.600
Don't stand there being impressed! Think up a new plan!

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:21.460
"Perfect Plan to Somehow Stop Ran from Running 2."

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:25.040
In short, "PSR2 - Anchor's the Way!"

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.220
Anchors what?

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.810
Here she comes!

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:39.120
Well, it almost worked...

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.930
"Perfect Plan to Somehow Stop Ran from Running 3."

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.320
In short, "PSR3 - Fear the Banana!"

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.520
A banana peel!

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.880
I can do it! I can do it!

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:03.270
Nope, I can't stop!

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:04.470
So close...

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.700
What's the matter-dechu?

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.140
Ran can't stop running.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:12.790
Oh, I see.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:13.780
In that case...

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.090
That's...

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.040
Go for it-dechu! You're almost to the goal-dechu!

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.470
The goal, huh?

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.750
Yay! First place!

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:30.490
She finally stopped.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.650
Victory!

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.960
See you again!

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.840
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:42.010
The first Character we'll introduce is... Kusukusu!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:48.470
Kusukusu is Rima's Guardian Character, who's the Queen's Chair.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:51.440
Her clown outfit is so adorable!

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:55.990
She loves comedy and has a trademark laugh.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:14.410
Continuing on, the second Character is... Yoru!

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:20.670
Yoru is Ikuto's Guardian Character. He's a stray cat that loves his freedom!

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:25.300
He's constantly getting into trouble and being scolded by Ikuto-nya!

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:29.870
But he always helps Ikuto when he's in a jam-nya!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.890
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions each week!

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.550
Look forward to it!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.710
Shugo, shugo! Egg Battle!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:51.630
Today we'll play "match the answer" with the Character Cubes!

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:54.220
We'll play a Shugo Chara Character song.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:06:00.290
If you know who's singing it, arrange that person's face on the cube!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.900
Ready, little Eggs?

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.300
Yeah!

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:08.740
Then here's the question: Who do you think is singing this song?

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.590
Do you know?

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:16.510
Spade doesn't seem very confident.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:18.000
Are you okay?

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.650
I think I know...

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:29.180
Even if you know who's singing, you have to solve the cube puzzle before you can answer!

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:33.120
I've got three squares done!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.760
You're so close!

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.880
The last part's the trickiest!

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.130
I'm not so good at those, myself.

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.150
Three! I got three again.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:44.400
Heart and Spade have finished three squares.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.300
That's the way!

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:54.690
How are you doing, Clover?

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.470
Keep at it!

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:59.610
I'm done! I'm done!

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.590
Spade, what's the answer?

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:02.740
Rima!

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:05.060
Correct!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.740
That was Rima-chan singing!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.100
Spade, you did it!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:16.650
Today's winner is Amulet Spade!

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:18.890
Do your best next time!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.530
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.890
"Place a Crab in the South-Southwest!"

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.580
A c-crab?!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:42.070
Oh, it's little.

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:44.770
Now that I look at it, it's cute.

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:47.590
But why is there a crab here?

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:50.260
Is that a daruma?

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.890
There's a picture of the moon!

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:55.090
And on the other side is the sun.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.690
What does this all mean?

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:01.780
What is this?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.180
"Place a crab in the south-southwest."

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.730
"Place a daruma in the north-northwest."

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:09.620
"A moon in the east, and a sun in the west?"

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:13.230
South-southwest and north-northwest? These are directions, aren't they?

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:17.220
It does look like they were left in the positions the memo said.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.210
Except the crab moved...

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:23.100
Perhaps this is some sort of code!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.030
A code?

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:26.790
I saw something like this on television yesterday!

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.720
That two-hour suspense drama, right?

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.130
There were some mysterious lyrics to a nursery rhyme...

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:35.950
And horrifying accidents happened, just like in the song!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.200
And people kept disappearing!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:42.030
Come on! That kind of stuff wouldn't ha-

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.670
Miki's missing!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:46.250
No way! If Miki's gone...

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.590
That means we're next!

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.030
And in the end...

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.100
No one will be left!

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.310
What's the matter?

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:00.760
Miki!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.480
Those were spells?

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:08.260
Yeah. I read about them in a spellbook and wanted to try them out.

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:13.820
It says that to attract a proud guy, you place a crab in the south-southwest.

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:18.230
And to attract a perpetually cheerful guy, you place a daruma in the north-northwest.

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:22.520
Also, if you draw a moon in the east, your artistic talent will grow.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:27.010
Plus, if you draw a sun in the west, you'll become more stylish!

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:29.000
I see!

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.730
What are you lot up to?

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:32.460
Kiseki!

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:38.770
What are you doing? Cease and desist!

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:42.610
Release me, you fiend! Do you think a lowly crab such as yourself can-

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:45.930
Doesn't look like the spells worked.

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:50.770
See you again!

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:55.900
Coming up next is Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki!

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:59.410
Today's episode is titled "Yaya's Enthusiastic Gardening!"

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.330
So Yaya-chan's the main character?

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.830
That means we'll see a lot of Pepe-chan, right?

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.110
I bet we will-dechu!

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:06.410
I can't wait-dechu!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.420
Watch it-dechu! Watch it-dechu!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.140
After the commercial-dechu!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:14.820
Babu! Babu! Babu!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:30.100
What's really important?

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:36.150
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:43.410
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:54.750
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:59.470
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:03.840
They're all precious things.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:08.010
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:09.540
Everything'll be okay.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.600
Because even if you feel lost,

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:16.030
you're not alone.

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.190
We'll always be together.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.830
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:23.860
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:27.040
Open Heart, now!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.700
You can see the eggs, right?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:33.710
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:39.550
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.770
I'll be counting on you!

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:51.060
One day after school.

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:58.810
Wow, how pretty!

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:00.030
Don't you think?

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:03.380
What is so special about an arrangement of flora?

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:07.750
Hikaru-chi, you're always so negative about everything.

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:13.170
So, Yaya-senpai, what's this job we're supposed to help the Guardians with?

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.710
Allow me to explain!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:20.090
It's to look after these flower beds!

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.180
That's right!

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:23.350
Wow, sounds fun!

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:26.150
Is that part of a Guardian's job, too?

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.080
But of course!

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:27.680
That's right!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.720
Basic, isn't it?

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.460
You there, no whining!

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:32.530
Now, let's do this thing!

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:33.560
Yeah!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:42.610
Yaya's Enthusiastic Gardening!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.940
You okay, Rikka-tan? 

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:50.750
Sorry 'bout that.

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.320
What are you doing?!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.290
That's a flower, you know!

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.750
But both flowers and grass are plants.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.680
Weeding is about pulling <i>weeds</i>-dechu!

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.570
Not the flowers-dechu!

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:06.910
Is that so?

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.270
You should have specified.

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.740
Just put it back-dechu.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:11.720
If you say so.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.360
That's right... Gently...

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.330
Gently...

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:20.260
Now tell the flowers to grow nicely and quickly.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:22.200
Talk to them as you water them!

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:22.610
Right!

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:26.910
I'm sorry, but I do not believe that plants can understand human speech.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:32.650
Sure, whatever. Get back to weeding.

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:34.410
Rikka-tan?

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.580
Rikka-tan?

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:39.420
Yaya-senpai! Mr. Ants are making a line!

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:43.520
Rikka-tan! Take this seriously!

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.850
"Mr. Ants?" Are you a baby?

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:47.260
Honestly-dechu!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:50.470
Hey, Hikaru-chi! Don't use water right from the hose!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.610
Use the watering can!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.610
Yaya's really going at it!

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:53.750
Yeah.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:55.740
She seems different today.

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:59.150
She certainly is not acting like a spoiled child.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:03.970
Yaya-chan thinks of Rikka and Hikaru-chan as precious underclassmen.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:07.570
I guess they draw out her natural wish to be a mentor.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.500
Amu-chi!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.120
Hi, Yaya! You sure are working hard.

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:14.500
Don't just stand there watching us, come help!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.180
R-Right!

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.640
You've got the hang of it now-dechu.

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:25.670
It's simple once you've learned how.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.300
Watch out, Amu.

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:28.680
For what?

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:33.980
I tried to warn you.

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:36.420
Sorry...

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.310
Yaya's really working hard.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.400
She is.

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:45.400
"All the flowers are healthy and look good today."

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:49.290
It sure is rare to see Yaya put in so much effort.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.900
True. It's a bit out of character.

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:53.920
Yep-dechu.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:15:00.870
But it's because me and Yaya have taken care of the flower beds ever since we became Guardians-dechu.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.880
Right from planting the seeds.

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:06.640
Hurry up and bloom, flowers!

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:09.680
Pepepepepe Pepe's seed!

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:12.740
And then they sprouted!

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:13.980
They sprouted!

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:16.350
And we spotted a pest!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.490
Extermination will proceed as planned, sir!

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:20.610
Atta girl, Yaya-tan!

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:22.360
We worked on rainy days.

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:24.200
On windy days.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:25.980
And snowy days, too.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.940
And then, finally...

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:40.530
To sum up, these flower beds are the culmination of our tears-dechu!

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:46.670
All you did was cheer her on though, right?

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.260
I see.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.200
So that's why.

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:59.210
You rock, Yaya-senpai!

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:01.450
What a Guardian!

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:02.390
Rikka-tan?

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:08.190
I'm going to take care of the flower beds with all my might, just like you!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.830
Rikka-tan!

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:14.020
All righty!

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:17.160
Let's all do our best!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.510
Now, let's go!

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:22.880
Hikaru! No spacing out! Get to work!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.480
And no slacking either, Amu-chi!

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:29.130
I think she might be a little too gung-ho.

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:34.130
After school the next day.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:40.340
I want to become a Guardian like Yaya-senpai as soon as I can!

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:43.750
But she's pretty late...

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:46.520
And Hikaru hasn't shown up, either.

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:49.510
Being by myself makes me feel a bit lonely.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:55.590
Huh? Where did you come from?

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:00.680
Hey, wanna help me out?

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.910
Crap! I totally forgot!

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:07.180
Yaya?

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:10.580
Sorry, I don't have time for you right now!

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:15.820
Yaya-chan fell asleep in class, so she had detention-dechu.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:16.770
Hey, don't rat me out!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:19.060
Guess some things never change.

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.810
Oh no!

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.910
Please stop!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.310
Rikka!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.300
Amu-senpai!

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:30.980
What is this?

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:34.130
What's going on here?

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:37.260
Um, there was this X Egg and-

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.620
Amu-chi, look!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:45.640
I worked so hard to take care of those flowers!

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:47.250
Yaya-tan, let's go-dechu!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:48.190
Su!

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:49.350
Right!

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:51.610
My heart:

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:52.880
My heart:

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.380
Unlock!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.330
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:08.400
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.790
Here we go!

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:31.790
Go Go Little Duckies!

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:34.550
Duckies!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:40.590
The duckies disappeared!

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:48.140
Rikka, what's the X Egg saying?

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:55.650
It really wanted to become a magician.

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.760
A magician?

00:18:57.760 --> 00:19:02.240
It wanted to do magic that would surprise everyone, but it couldn't.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.990
I see. So that's why it made the flowers big.

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:07.250
It wanted to surprise everyone!

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.800
Hey, wow!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.680
You could totally become a magician with that!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:21.740
Boring.

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:26.690
That's just an ordinary magic trick.

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.160
Try reading the mood a bit, will ya?

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:31.500
No, Hikaru-kun is right.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.620
You're doing this all wrong!

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:38.030
Messing up those flower beds will cause people trouble, right?

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:41.180
Magic's supposed to make people happy!

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:42.820
So why are you causing trouble instead?

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:48.440
If you think about how to make people happy, you're sure to come up with some great ideas.

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:54.420
Then you could do magic that'll surprise even Hikaru-kun, who just said he was bored.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:01.340
Negative heart: Lock On!

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.280
Open Heart!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.060
We did it! We did it!

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:22.910
The flower beds!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:35.820
I'm sorry... This is all my fault...

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:37.460
Don't worry.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.750
Leave it to Amu-chan!

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:48.220
Remake Honey!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:05.200
Yay! It's back to how it was!

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:12.580
Do your best to take care of the flower beds tomorrow, okay?

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:15.260
Right!

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:18.720
How about taking care of Yaya, huh?

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:22.180
I'm pooped!

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.680
Take care of me! Take care of me!

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:26.420
Babu!

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:27.940
Yaya...

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:34.890
It seems Remake Honey returned Yaya-chan to her old spoiled baby self...

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:37.530
Someone take care of Yaya!

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:40.000
I need some TLC!

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:47.320
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:51.320
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:56.320
Which egg will be the lucky one?

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:01.960
Guardian Egg Romance Fortune!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.300
First, for those who chose Dia:

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.380
Four Shugoluck Stars!

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:07.020
Super Lucky!

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:09.220
You're destined to be mega-popular!

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:12.120
Take this chance to confess your love!

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.850
Su's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars!

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:16.940
Attack your crush with honesty! It'll work out!

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:16.940
Be assertive with the person you like!

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:18.810
Miki's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:22.080
Get a new cell phone strap and your luck might improve!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:22.080
You might get a text from someone you're interested in.

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:25.740
Finally, for those who chose Ran's egg:

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:28.570
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:31.080
The person you like might misunderstand you.

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:34.240
But don't lie! Always be yourself, okay?

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:36.910
Your lucky item is a stuffed animal!

00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:42.060
See you next time on Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:45.110
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:47.670
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
